cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CIS-2: a specification and verifier for bit-exact, reproducible LLM inference, with receipts for agent tool calls"
message: "If you use this specification, verifier, results or verification kit, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Justin
    family-names: Thompson
    affiliation: Aefinity AI
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aefinity-AI/cis2-spec"
abstract: >-
  A written specification for bit-exact, cross-architecture large language model
  inference, together with an independent verifier, replayable receipts for agent
  tool calls, and a receipt-gated enforcement boundary for agent tool use. Includes
  measured results on single-weight corruption detection, receipt-verified
  evaluation, fuzzing of both the verifier and the gateway, and a downloadable
  verification kit with static x86_64 and aarch64 binaries that reproduces the
  pinned digests on a third party's own machine.
keywords:
  - reproducible inference
  - verifiable machine learning
  - AI agent safety
  - model integrity
  - conformance testing
license: Apache-2.0
version: v0.4
date-released: "2026-09-14"
